────────────────────

<This • flex-row p:16
    <Box • gallery-panel flex-col flex:1 p:12
        <Label • panel-title h:22
            text = "Drop targets"
        <Label • panel-note h:34
            text = "".join
                * "Drag a swatch onto a well. "
                * "The warm well refuses cool colors and the cursor says so."
